{
  "name": "mode-plan-blocks-tools",
  "about": "plan 模式（set_permission_mode plan）下，工具运行时在 schema 校验与权限判断之前按 PLAN_MODE_ALLOWED_TOOLS 拦截（ToolRuntime.ts:129-139,706-764）。第 1 轮在默认模式：execute_code 的 Python 脚本只要不调 write_file/edit_file/bash 就判为只读，不经询问直接执行（open().write()、os.system() 也算），且继承宿主环境变量——这是基线自身的弱点，两侧照基线一致，这一轮只作记录。其后各轮在 plan 模式：白名单外的工具（execute_code；参数不合 schema 时也先报 plan_mode_violation）被拦；bash 非只读命令被拦（超过 120 个字符的命令在文案里截断），只读命令放行；write_file/edit_file 只放行计划目录（<cwd>/.pilotdeck/plans）下以 .md 结尾（不区分大小写）的路径，计划目录外、非 .md、经 .. 跳出的都被拦；用 filePath 别名指向计划目录的调用通过拦截后照常报 schema 错误；read_file 放行。submit_turn 不带 allowPlanModeTools（缺省即不向模型声明 enter_plan_mode/exit_plan_mode）。采集器对任何权限询问一律拒绝。",
  "env": {
    "BBX_FAKE_TOKEN": "fake-secret-123"
  },
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\": \"Tool run\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "turn-12-after-tool",
      "when": [
        "turn-12:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_bbx_12\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Done 12."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "turn-12",
      "when": [
        "turn-12:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_bbx_12",
          "name": "read_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": ".pilotdeck/plans/plan-a.md"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "turn-11-after-tool",
      "when": [
        "turn-11:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_bbx_11\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Done 11."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "turn-11",
      "when": [
        "turn-11:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_bbx_11",
          "name": "write_file",
          "arguments": {
            "filePath": "{PILOT_HOME}/.pilotdeck/plans/UPPER.MD",
            "content": "alias\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "turn-10-after-tool",
      "when": [
        "turn-10:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_bbx_10\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Done 10."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "turn-10",
      "when": [
        "turn-10:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_bbx_10",
          "name": "edit_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": ".pilotdeck/plans/../escape.md",
            "old_string": "a",
            "new_string": "b"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "turn-9-after-tool",
      "when": [
        "turn-9:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_bbx_9\""
      ],
